{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1777876,"known_for_department":"Visual Effects","name":"Ian White","original_name":"Ian White","popularity":0.1339,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nYs4ZwnJBK4AgljhvzwNz7fpr3E.jpg","id":10681,"title":"WALL·E","original_title":"WALL·E","overview":"After hundreds of years doing what he was built for, WALL•E— a robot designed to clean up the earth—discovers a new purpose in life when he meets a sleek search robot named EVE. EVE comes to realize that WALL•E has inadvertently stumbled upon the key to the planet's future, and races back to space to report to the humans. Meanwhile, WALL•E chases EVE across the galaxy and sets into motion one of the most imaginative adventures ever brought to the big screen.","poster_path":"/hbhFnRzzg6ZDmm8YAmxBnQpQIPh.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[16,10751,878],"popularity":36.3037,"release_date":"2008-06-26","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.118,"vote_count":20581},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jQ6Vuxe1CEPMXTF7d0fZgdIBY8U.jpg","id":2062,"title":"Ratatouille","original_title":"Ratatouille","overview":"Remy, a rat, possesses a palate far more refined than that of his fellow comrades. He aspires to become a chef, one who creates rather than scavenges. When fate leads him beneath one of Paris's finest restaurants, he forms an unusual alliance with a young kitchen worker to pursue his culinary ambitions. As his double life unfolds, Remy must navigate the suspicions of the calculating Head Chef Skinner, the disapproval of Remy’s own colony, and the foreboding presence of renowned food critic Anton Ego, whose judgment can make or break a chef's legacy.","poster_path":"/t3vaWRPSf6WjDSamIkKDs1iQWna.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[16,35,10751,14],"popularity":32.4428,"release_date":"2007-06-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.845,"vote_count":18718},{"adult":false,"ba